    },
    "# Release plan\n\nThe text below a heading, for comparing sizes and spacing.\n\n## Goals\n\nReading, editing and working with agents.\n\n### Details\n\nOne more paragraph." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# 发布计划\n\n标题下方的正文，用来比较字号与间距。\n\n## 目标\n\n阅读、编辑，以及与代理协作。\n\n### 细节\n\n再多一段文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "# Release plan\n\nThe text below a heading, for comparing sizes and spacing.\n\n> A short quote.\n\n| Stage | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Draft | Done |" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# 发布计划\n\n标题下方的正文，用来比较字号与间距。\n\n> 一小段引用。\n\n| 阶段 | 状态 |\n|---|---|\n| 草稿 | 完成 |"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "## A quiet place to read\n\nGood reading starts with comfortable type and line spacing. 好的阅读，从清晰的文字和舒适的行距开始。\n\nThe column leaves room on both sides." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "## 安静地阅读\n\n好的阅读，从清晰的文字和舒适的行距开始。Good reading starts with comfortable type and line spacing.\n\n阅读栏的两侧留出空间。"
          }
        }
      }
