    },
    "A paragraph with enough text to show alignment, line spacing and the first-line indent. 段落里的中英文可以一起展示对齐、行距和首行缩进的效果。\n\nA second paragraph shows the space between paragraphs.\n\n- Read the draft\n- Review the layout\n  - Check the details\n\n> Keep the important words in view." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "段落里的中英文可以一起展示对齐、行距和首行缩进的效果。A paragraph shows alignment, line spacing and the first-line indent.\n\n第二段文字展示段落之间的距离。\n\n- 阅读草稿\n- 检查排版\n  - 核对细节\n\n> 让重要的文字留在视线里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
