    "Lay out this note as a Zephyr page. Each “## heading” is a block: tasks (- [ ] …), links to notes (- [Title](path)), figures (- Label: value) or any Markdown; a line <!-- zephyr: wide --> under a heading gives it the full width, and <!-- zephyr: today --> (or goals, activity, recent) brings in a live block. The page is for: " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把这篇笔记排成 Zephyr 页面。每个“## 标题”是一个块：待办（- [ ] …）、指向笔记的链接（- [标题](路径)）、数字（- 名称: 值）或任意 Markdown；标题下一行写 <!-- zephyr: wide --> 让它占满整行，写 <!-- zephyr: today -->（或 goals、activity、recent）放入实时块。这个页面用来："
